  "title": "nVent SCHROFF Launches AirBender and Air Inlet Card: Effortless Cooling Innovation for High-Density Electronics",
  "summary": "nVent SCHROFF Launches AirBender and Air Inlet Card: Effortless Cooling Innovation for High-Density ElectronicsnVent Electric plc (NYSE:NVT) (“nVent”), a global leader in electrical connection and protection solutions, proudly announces the launch of the nVent SCHROFF cooling accessories—the AirBender Inlay and the Air Inlet Card. Designed to significantly enhance airflow performance in air-cooled systems, these innovations deliver measurable improvements in thermal efficiency with minimal integration effort.",
